# Product Branch Folder Layout

**`main`** = MongoDB portfolio demo (v1). **`product`** = PostgreSQL sellable line (v2).

On **`product`**, backend uses a **single top-level layout** — no `models/product/`, `routes/product/`, or `tests/product/` subfolders (Phase 3 flatten done).

## Backend (product branch)

| Area | Path |
|------|------|
| Models | `backend/models/` (`user.py`, `stock.py`; `order.py` until Phase 2) |
| Schemas | `backend/schemas/` (`user.py`, `stock.py`, `order.py` until Phase 2) |
| Routes | `backend/routes/` (`auth`, `security`, `stock`, `health`; `orders` until Phase 2) |
| Dependencies | `backend/dependencies/` (`auth.py` PG owner; `mongo_auth.py` until Phase 2) |
| Services | `backend/services/` (`stock_queries.py`, `stock_summary_service.py`, …) |
| Tests | `backend/tests/test_*.py`; legacy Mongo orders in `backend/tests/mongo/` |

```text
backend/tests/
  conftest.py           # PG fixtures, owner clients, skip_startup_postgres_ping
  test_stock_api.py     # v2 PG stock
  test_auth.py          # v2 owner auth
  mongo/                # v1 Mongo orders (Phase 2 delete)
    conftest.py
    test_orders_api.py
```

## Roles in tests

| Area | Roles |
|------|-------|
| `tests/test_*.py` (PG) | `owner` only |
| `tests/mongo/` (legacy) | `admin`, `user`, `guest` until Phase 2 |

## Avoid

- Reintroducing `*/product/` subfolders on product branch
- v1 role names in PG tests (`tests/test_*.py`)
- Importing v1 `tea` artifacts on product branch

See `product-branch-cleanup.mdc` for Phase 2 (Mongo orders delete) and remaining infra items.
